6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-03T09:57:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T08:25:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119195","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119195","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119195.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119195.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is a small patch aimed at improving the performance of GraphEdit node for big graphs (on the scale of hundreds of nodes and connections within).\r\n\r\nIt consists of three things:\r\n1. Lower the amount of `GraphEdit::_top_connection_layer_update()` calls per frame by putting guards on its deferred calls\r\n\r\nA lot of functions within GraphEdit would make a deferred call to `GraphEdit::_top_connection_layer_update()`, usually without checking if there is an update pending. In one of the more severe examples, during the scroll offset changes, all of the GraphElement nodes would be moved, causing a deferred call to `GraphEdit::_top_connection_layer_update()` from the `node_rect_changed` callback for each GraphElement. This PR adds an internal boolean to check for a pending call and alters the callsites to minimize such scenarios.\r\n\r\n2. Add a preliminary GraphNode rect check for `GraphEdit::_filter_input()` to skip processing offscreen nodes' ports\r\n\r\nFor large graphs, a lot of the time can be spent during input handling inside the `GraphEdit::_filter_input()` since it has to check every port on every GraphNode. This PR adds a preliminary test for whether is the GraphNode's rectangle (adjusted for ports' outer extents) is visible on screen before checking the ports, eliminating a lot of work for big graphs and graphs with many ports on individual nodes.\r\n\r\n3. Move `viewport_rect` calculations in `GraphEdit::_update_connections()` out of the loop as viewport's rect doesn't change within the call\r\n\r\nThat's pretty much it – cache the viewport rectangle instead of recalculating it for every loop iteration.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119195/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}